## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=test test1.js test2.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "recommended": false
    },
    "domains": {
      "test": "all"
    }
  }
}
```

## `test1.js`

```js
describe.only("bar", () => {});

```

## `test2.js`

```js

describe("foo", () => {
	beforeEach(() => {});
    beforeEach(() => {});
    test("bar", () => {
        someFn();
    });
});
    
```

